<p>Improves your capacity to see invisible foes by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">+19, +24, +29, +32, +35</acronym> and to see through stealth by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100">+19, +24, +29, +32, +35.</acronym>  Additionally you have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6%, 15%, 21%, 24%, 27%</acronym> chance to recover from a single negative status effect each turn.</p><p>Sense abilities will scale with your Magic stat.</p>